{
  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-125697",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "$$\n\nThe definition of $\\operatorname{csch}⁡x$ is \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡x=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}=\\frac{2}{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csch}⁡(\\sqrt{7}\\,t)=\\frac{2}{{e}^{\\sqrt{7}\\,t}-{e}^{-\\sqrt{7}\\,t}}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
